Speaking of which, you probably figured out that I was kind of pulling your leg.

285
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:12,080
Yeah, about the brick mason historic recordings.

286
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:19,800
Well, you know, strictly they're historic if last week is a part of history, isn't it?

287
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:20,180
Yeah.

288
00:22:20,180 --> 00:22:25,660
So before we go, let's hear from our founder, Sir Robert.

289
00:22:26,980 --> 00:22:29,260
Good luck to you and good camping.

290
00:22:30,220 --> 00:22:31,380
Why, thank you very much, sir.

291
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,140
So until next time.

292
